1. WHAT YOU MAY DO, FREE OF CHARGE

You may, at no cost and without asking permission:

  a) Download, install and run AirLoad Station on any number of computers,
     including for commercial airline and ground handling operations.

  b) Use it to produce loadsheets, trim sheets, forms and other operational
     documents, and use those documents for any purpose, including
     commercially. Documents you produce are yours.

  c) Use the form definitions in this repository as a starting point for your
     own airline's internal forms, and modify them for your own operational
     use.

  d) Copy the installer within your own organisation — between stations, onto
     a USB stick, across an intranet — so a station with no internet can be
     set up.

No registration, no licence key, no seat count, and no expiry.


