  b) Sell, rent, lease, sublicense or otherwise charge for this software or
     the form definitions, whether alone or as part of another product or
     service.

  c) Rebrand this software, or remove or alter its name, authorship or
     notices, or present it as your own or another party's product.

  d) Incorporate the software or the form definitions into a competing
     product, or into any product or service offered to third parties.

  e) Reverse engineer, decompile or disassemble the software, except to the
     extent applicable law expressly permits despite this restriction.

To do any of the above, write to mohammad.ghodrati@gmail.com. Permission is
often given; it simply has to be asked for.


3. NOT OFFICIAL, AND NOT A SUBSTITUTE FOR YOUR OWN PROCEDURES

The form definitions in this repository are IMPLEMENTATION TEMPLATES. They are
not reproductions of, and carry no endorsement from, ICAO, IATA, the FAA,
EASA, or any civil aviation authority. The standard weight tables shipped with
the software are UNAPPROVED SAMPLES.

Before any operational use you must verify every regulatory requirement
against current authorised sources, and replace sample data with your own
airline's approved figures.


